# This project has one env file per app. Copy the templates:
#
#   backend/.env.example   -> backend/.env          (secrets: Supabase secret key, RunPod key)
#   frontend/.env.example  -> frontend/.env.local   (public values only)
#
# In production the same variables go into the hosting platform's secret settings
# (Vercel for the frontend, the backend host for the backend), never into git.
